    "preamble": "M/S.Citizen Consumer And Civic Action ... vs The Union Of India on 3 July, 2024 Author: Mohammed Shaffiq Bench: R.Mahadevan, Mohammed Shaffiq W.P.No.13642 of IN THE HIGH COURT OF JUDICATURE AT MADRAS DATED: 03.07.2024 CORAM : THE HON'BLE MR.R.MAHADEVAN, ACTING CHIEF JUSTICE AND THE HON'BLE MR.JUSTICE MOHAMMED SHAFFIQ W.P.No.13642 of 2021 M/s. Citizen Consumer and Civic Action Group Rep by its Trustee, Dr.Hema Ramakrishnan New No.246 (Old No.277B), TTK Road (J.J.Road), Alwarpet Chennai - 600 018. .. Petitioner Vs 1 The Union of India Rep by its Secretary Ministry of Education Department of School Education and Literacy Shastri Bhawan, Dr.Rajendra Prasad Road New Delhi - 110 001. 2 The Union of India Rep by its Secretary (MDM) Ministry of Education Department of School Education and Literacy Shastri Bhawan, Dr.Rajendra Prasad Road New Delhi 110 001. 3 The Union of India Rep by its Secretary Ministry of Women and Child Development Shastri Bhawan, Dr. Rajendra Prasad Road New Delhi - 110 001. M/S.Citizen Consumer And Civic Action ... vs The Union Of India on 3 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/128916681/ 1 __________ Page 1 of 8 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No.1364 4 The State of TamilNadu Rep by its Secretary Ministry of Social Welfare Department of Social Welfare and Nutritious Meal Programme Secretariat, Fort St.George Chennai 600 009. 5 The Commissioner of Social Welfare 2nd Floor, Panagal Maaligai, Saidapet Chennai 600 015. 6 The Director cum Mission Director Integrated Child Development Services No.1, Pammal Nallathambi Street Taramani, Chennai - 600 113. .. Responde Prayer: Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of Ind seeking issuance of a writ of mandamus directing the respondents to take appropriate actions for the distribution of nutritious meal to children eligible under the Puratchi Thalaivar M.G.R.Nutritious Mea Programme in line with the mandates of Sections 5, 6 and 7 with Schedule II of the National Food Security Act, 2013 on a daily basis. For the Petitioner : Mr.N.L.Rajah Senior Counsel for Mr.K.R.Arun Shabari For the Respondents : Mr.A.Edwin Prabakar State Government Pleader for respondents 4 to 6 __________ Page 2 of 8 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W M/S.Citizen Consumer And Civic Action ... vs The Union Of India on 3 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/128916681/ 2 : Mr.R.Rajesh Vivekana Deputy Solicitor G for respondents 1 ORDER (Order of the Court was made by the Hon'ble Acting Chief Justice)",
